# Build and restart after changes

After making code changes in this repo, build and restart the app before ending your turn — do not ask the user to reload manually.

## Workflow

1. Stop any running app instance (Electron / `pnpm start` / `pnpm dev`).
2. Run `pnpm build` from the repo root and fix build failures before continuing.
3. Start the app with `pnpm start` in the background.

## Commands (Windows / PowerShell)

```powershell
Get-Process -Name electron -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force
pnpm build
pnpm start
```

Use `pnpm dev` only when the user explicitly asks for hot-reload development mode.

## When to skip

- Question-only or review-only tasks with no code changes.
- A build/restart was already done in the same turn for the same changes.
